      "key_excerpt": "The code of practice helps industry comply with the AI Act legal obligations on safety, transparency and copyright of general-purpose AI models. The General-Purpose AI (GPAI) code of practice is a voluntary tool, prepared by independent experts in a multi-stakeholder process, designed to help industry comply with the AI Act's obligations for providers of general-purpose AI models. The code was published on July 10, 2025.",
